# 📖 Revision Cheat Sheet

| Concept               | Key Point                                     |
| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| Authentication        | Verifies identity                             |
| Authorization         | Determines permissions                        |
| Broken Authentication | Weak or insecure login mechanisms             |
| Brute Force           | Many passwords against one account            |
| Password Spraying     | One common password against many accounts     |
| Credential Stuffing   | Reusing leaked credentials                    |
| MFA                   | Multiple authentication factors               |
| Broken Access Control | Users access unauthorized resources           |
| IDOR                  | Missing authorization checks on object access |
| RBAC                  | Permissions based on roles                    |
| Least Privilege       | Minimum required permissions only             |

